#: cartpops.php
#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://cartpops.com"
msgstr "https://cartpops.com"

#: cartpops.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"The #1 WooCommerce cart drawer plugin. Boost conversions with a beautiful "
"slide-out cart, product recommendations, and free shipping meter."
msgstr ""
"Najbolji WooCommerce dodatak za bočnu košaricu. Povećajte konverzije "
"prekrasnom kliznom košaricom, preporukama proizvoda i mjeračem besplatne "
"dostave."

#: cartpops.php:56
msgid ""
"CartPops detected both the Free and Pro editions as active. CartPops was "
"paused; deactivate one edition and reload this page."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je otkrio da su i besplatna i Pro verzija aktivne. CartPops je "
"pauziran; deaktivirajte jedno izdanje i ponovno učitajte ovu stranicu."

#: cartpops.php:148
msgid ""
"CartPops could not safely verify upgrade state. CartPops was paused before "
"licensing initialization; reload this page or contact support."
msgstr ""
"CartPops nije mogao sigurno provjeriti stanje nadogradnje. CartPops je "
"pauziran prije pokretanja licenciranja; ponovno učitajte ovu stranicu ili "
"kontaktirajte podršku."

#: cartpops.php:406
msgid ""
"CartPops licensing could not initialize. Shared cart features remain "
"available, but paid features are paused. Reinstall the complete CartPops "
"package or contact support."
msgstr ""
"Licenciranje za CartPops nije se moglo pokrenuti. Zajedničke značajke "
"košarice ostaju dostupne, ali su plaćene značajke pauzirane. Ponovno "
"instalirajte cijeli CartPops paket ili kontaktirajte podršku."

